    77	### Occupancy implication (CDNA4, 64 KB LDS/CU)
    78	`floor(64 KB / 24.5 KB) = 2` workgroups can co-reside per CU **from LDS alone**. With 4 waves/wg → **8 waves/CU** resident. This is the binding occupancy constraint (see §6).
