    53	Two opcode families with sharply different cost:
    54	
    55	**Frame ops — O(1)** (`svm_kernels.inl:60-116`): `OP_FRAME_{CNOT,CZ,H,S,S_DAG,
    56	SWAP}` touch only the Pauli-frame bitsets `p_x/p_z` (a few `bit_get/bit_xor`).
