   131	
   132	Common gates for every step:
   133	1. Correctness gate (exact integer match): `passed_shots` + `observable_ones` vs SVM, seed-fixed, plus determinism rerun same seed.
   134	2. Performance gate: kernel-trace medians and V2/SVM ratio.
   135	3. Regression guard: no >3% slowdown on already-winning global circuits.
