   192	
   193	## 8) Execution Order (Concrete)
   194	
   195	1. Implement P0 rank routing + thread-tier kernel skeleton; validate low-rank collapse immediately.
   196	2. Implement P1 LDS compaction trio (`red[4]`, `scratch[512]`, `meas bitset`); reprofile coop.
   197	3. Implement P2 safe barrier trims + frame-run batching; reprofile coop/frame-heavy.
